  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Those Immortal Gu are no longer a comprehensive set, so they can barely form the move. It is not specially suited to his needs, but it is the strongest method he can use then. He has never used it before. Its structure is simple, it uses few Immortal Gu, and its steps are uncomplicated. He tries it against the investigative killer move on him. A mysterious light spreads from his body, then collapses with a muffled sound. His body shakes and blood runs from his nose. He recovers with Man as Before and tries again, failing through several further attempts. After those attempts he finds that the move cannot break the investigative killer move on him, and he looks for a stronger method.",
